subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":1080935,"digest":"sha256:8e932f1a7714cbb2ea6167c48f8a719c583dc707a55a4cf1dbb72ad4e5a8b0f3","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/menudoproblema/mongoeco/releases/download/v4.11.0/mongoeco-4.11.0.tar.gz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/menudoproblema/mongoeco/releases/assets/649552193","id":649552193,"node_id":"RA_kwDORzb4Ns4mt2FB","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"menudoproblema","id":976187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NjE4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/976187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema","html_url":"https://github.com/menudoproblema","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menudoproblema/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":188,"digest":"sha256:053f0e18cfb8363d85ed2b57ac2b2a119fdfbb943e6dcd80ee194e079208499e","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/menudoproblema/mongoeco/releases/download/v4.11.0/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/menudoproblema/mongoeco/tarball/v4.11.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/menudoproblema/mongoeco/zipball/v4.11.0","body":"Mongoeco 4.11.0 adds optional wire diagnostics for pytest and strengthens the supported MongoDB subset while simplifying engine internals.\n\n- Opt in with `pytest --mongoeco-wire-diagnostics`: bounded metadata and failure reports after teardown, including sync/async adapters and parallel workers. Snapshots retain no BSON, credentials or URIs and open no resources.\n- Share wire length, OP_MSG flag and CRC32C validation between proxy and driver. Preserve native error codes, reply suppression and connection reuse or close behavior.\n- Reuse one prepared request context for execution and diagnostics; preserve the first failure and distinguish preparation, execution, encoding and send phases.\n- Reject invalid wire find filters with code 14 and malformed query regex with code 51091, including empty/no-match paths.\n- Consolidate typed engine preparation and cursor sources, retain atomic revalidation and remove unused private SQLite wrappers.\n- Strengthen independent SPI v2 conformance and native observation source guards. Preserve existing API use, Engine SPI v2 and SQLite files; no storage migration is required.\n\nThe finite MongoDB 7/8/9 corpus covers codes, counters, effects and recovery. It does not claim universal compatibility, replication or distributed transactions. Diagnostics are disabled by default.\n\nInstall: `python -m pip install mongoeco==4.11.0` or `python -m pip install \"mongoeco[pytest]==4.11.0\"`.\n\n[Release notes and evidence](https://github.com/menudoproblema/mongoeco/blob/main/docs/release-4.11.0.md) · [Changelog](https://github.com/menudoproblema/mongoeco/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#4110---2026-10-17)\n\nValidation: 45,208 tests and 14,463 subtests passed per Python 3.13/3.14/3.15; installed coverage 99.04%. All twelve pytest/PyMongo kit cells and MongoDB 7/8/9 release gates passed. Public wheel installation, 563 regression tests, SPI v2 conformance for Memory/SQLite and installation by name from the official PyPI index also passed. PyPI and both CI builds serve byte-identical distributions with matching public publisher provenance.\n"}
